Carry-out printing-prelude:
    say ```
        "Kion, wake up."
         
        Kion stirs, and opens his eyes slowly, "Hmm, what?"
        
        When his eyes come into focus Kion sees Rani hovering over him. She yawns deeply, "Kion, it’s morning, it’s time for the Guard to take their shift."
        
        "Oh, yeah, I’m up," Kion says stretching. As he rises Rani lies down and watches him for a moment. Kion shakes his mane and turns to her. "You know, we really have to figure out a way we’re not always awake at different times. I feel like we don’t get to spend much time with each other lately."
        
        Rani smiles drowsily, "Yes, I agree, I’ve just been so busy…" she yawns again and sets her chin on her paws.
        
        "That’s OK," Kion says nuzzling her affectionately, "right now you need rest. Me and the Guard will be on patrol soon."
        
        "Alright…" Rani replies as her eyes close.
        
        ---- You are playing as Kion! What do you want to do? ----
        
        ```

